{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "41699726",
      "title": "Understanding File-based Routing & React Server Components",
      "sourceHash": "e099623a84a0d7ea3fde68a9154f5d87d8288f72581d44bd7981683d826a0616",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.51,
          "end": 2.55,
          "en": "So we got this next project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.55,
          "end": 5.04,
          "en": "and how does this project now lead",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.04,
          "end": 7.383,
          "en": "to this being visible on the screen?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.4,
          "end": 9.72,
          "en": "Well, to understand that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 9.72,
          "end": 11.91,
          "en": "let's take a look at that app folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 11.91,
          "end": 15.45,
          "en": "because that is the most important folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15.45,
          "end": 18.93,
          "en": "in a modern NextJS project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 18.93,
          "end": 23.37,
          "en": "It's this app folder where you set up your different pages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.37,
          "end": 26.7,
          "en": "that you want to have on your overall website,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.7,
          "end": 31.053,
          "en": "and that's why in there, you also find a Page.js file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.49,
          "end": 37.49,
          "en": "Page.js is a reserved filename just as Layout.js",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 37.59,
          "end": 39.3,
          "en": "and a couple of other filenames",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.3,
          "end": 42.33,
          "en": "you'll encounter throughout this section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 42.33,
          "end": 46.65,
          "en": "And a file named Page.js simply tells NextJS",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.65,
          "end": 48.843,
          "en": "that it should render a page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 50.16,
          "end": 52.14,
          "en": "However, if you take a look at that file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 52.14,
          "end": 53.52,
          "en": "you see that in there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 53.52,
          "end": 56.37,
          "en": "it's in the end a React component function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 56.37,
          "end": 58.17,
          "en": "that's stored in the file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 58.17,
          "end": 61.803,
          "en": "something you of course know as a React developer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 62.94,
          "end": 65.91,
          "en": "The special thing about this component here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 65.91,
          "end": 69.9,
          "en": "just is that it's a so-called server component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 69.9,
          "end": 71.46000000000001,
          "en": "a type of component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 71.46000000000001,
          "end": 76.26,
          "en": "that's not really easily built with just React,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 76.26,
          "end": 79.473,
          "en": "but that is embraced and supported by NextJS.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 80.49,
          "end": 84.45,
          "en": "Now, on the surface, it's a regular component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 84.45,
          "end": 86.31,
          "en": "There's nothing special about it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 86.31,
          "end": 89.85,
          "en": "but NextJS ensures that this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 89.85,
          "end": 92.16,
          "en": "is actually rendered on the server,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 92.16,
          "end": 95.583,
          "en": "that this component function is executed on the server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 96.57,
          "end": 98.28,
          "en": "Hence, if you, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 98.28,
          "end": 102.60300000000001,
          "en": "add a console lock statement here where you say executing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 103.74000000000001,
          "end": 106.92,
          "en": "you will not see that here on the client side.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 106.92,
          "end": 108.507,
          "en": "If you open your developer tools",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 108.507,
          "end": 110.64,
          "en": "and the JavaScript console,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 110.64,
          "end": 113.03999999999999,
          "en": "you can refresh as often as you want,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 113.03999999999999,
          "end": 115.533,
          "en": "you will not see that log statement here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 117.09,
          "end": 119.94,
          "en": "Instead, you can see it on the backend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 119.94,
          "end": 121.71,
          "en": "There, if you open the terminal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 121.71,
          "end": 124.14,
          "en": "where you started the development server,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 124.14,
          "end": 126.7,
          "en": "you see all these executing logs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 127.71,
          "end": 130.44,
          "en": "and that proves that it's executing on the server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 130.44,
          "end": 131.79,
          "en": "because this process",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 131.79,
          "end": 134.25,
          "en": "and the terminal is running the server,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 134.25,
          "end": 137.313,
          "en": "all the logs here are coming from the server side.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 138.69,
          "end": 141.3,
          "en": "So it's a regular React component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 141.3,
          "end": 144.78,
          "en": "but treated in a special way by NextJS.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 144.78,
          "end": 147.54,
          "en": "It is treated as a server component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 147.54,
          "end": 149.463,
          "en": "and executed on the server,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 150.32999999999998,
          "end": 152.67000000000002,
          "en": "and it's then the returned JSX code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 152.67000000000002,
          "end": 156.39,
          "en": "that's sent over the wire to the browser to be rendered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 156.39,
          "end": 159.15,
          "en": "as HTML, so to say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 159.15,
          "end": 161.61,
          "en": "and that's why we can see what we see here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 161.61,
          "end": 163.413,
          "en": "thanks to this component.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}